_FBC - TEXT EDITOR

_Move around:
|arrows|	Move around
|PgeUp|	Top Page / Page Up
|PgeDn|	Bottom Page / Page Down
|Home|	Start of Line
|Home Home|	Start of File
|End|	End of Line
|End End|	End of File
|Sh-|(above)	Define / Extend Block (whole Lines)

|^ <-| or |^T|	Move previous word
|^ ->| or |^Y|	Move next word

|^E|	eXchange position with the Bookmark
|^G|o to	Go to Line Number
|^W|	Go to Matching Bracket |() [] {}|

_Search:
|^F|ind	Find text:
	  |^F| changes Find Mode: Strict, Case Insensitive OR Allow wilds (|#@&?~^|)
	  |up down| goes thru search history
|^N|ext	Find next occurrence
|^P|rev	Find previous occurrence

_Make Changes:
	Just type characters to insert text
|Ins|	Insert Space
|Del|	Delete character at cursor
|BackSpace|	Delete character left of cursor / Append lines
|Enter|	New Line / Split Line
|Alt-Enter|	New Line (no split). Same as |End|, |Enter|
|Tab|	Insert Tab character

|^K|	Change Case of Word: lower > Mixed > UPPER
|^A|	Auto Complete identifier (Based on preceeding text. Repeatable)
|^D|	Duplicate Line
|^Del|	Delete word OR Spaces
|Alt-Del| or |^L|	Delete to End of Line
|Sh-Del|	Delete Line
|^up|	Move line up
|^down|	Move line down
|Sh <-| or |^]|	Outdent Line / Block
|Sh ->| or |^\\|	Indent Line / Block

_Clipboard Comands:
|^C|	Block Copy to Clipboard. If no Block defined, use Word / Quote / Bracketted / Rest of line
|^X|	Block Cut to Clipboard. "
|^V|	Paste Clipboard at cursor

_Block Comands:
|^B^B|	Define Block begin / end
|^B^A|	Define Block as entire file
|^B^G|	Go to Block
|^B^T|	Block expand/compress Tabs
|^B^H|	Block convert between Hex and Hex/"ASCII"
|^B^I|	Block convert between Hex and ASCII
|^B^F|	Block Format: Fill lines with words, Break lines, Preserve paragraph breaks
|^B^R|	Read Block from file
|^B^W|	Write Block to file
|^B^C|	Compare Block with Clipboard
	  Specify the Sync Threshold (number ofcharacters)
	  Result will be in Clipboard
	  Common sections are included
	  Text unique to the original Clipboard are shown |<####example####>|
	  Text unique to the Block are shown |<<####example####>>|

_Macros:
|^R Key|	Record subsequent keystrokes to a Key/Alt-Key/^Key. |^R| finishes
	These can contain any commands and/or text. Create super commands
|^R Key ^R|	Clear the macro on Key
|Key|	Replay recorded macro. If in Block, it repeats until out of Block
|^R ^R|	Display all the Macros

_Other:
|^Z|	Undo (unlimited)
set|^U|p	Editor settings
	Parameters: (use |Up| / |Down|)
	  [1] Type Mode - Insert OR Overwrite (where typing replaces rather than inserts)
	  [2] Tab Size - Defines how tabs are displayed AND converted (see |^B^T|)
	  [3] Auto Indent - After |Enter| spaces are added to match previous line
	  [4] Outdent Destructive - Allows non blank characters to be deleted while Outdenting
	  [5] Syntax Highlight - Manually select sytax (normally set by file\'s extension)
|^S|ave	Save File
|Esc|	Quit:
	  Allows renaming the file before saving
	  |Enter| to save
	  |Esc| returns to editor
	  |^D| to Discard changes and exit
	  |^F| to change the file format: |LF| > |CR+LF| > |CR|
